  "slug": "guest-incident-order-form",
  "title": "Guest Incident Order Form",
  "subtitle": "Authorize and track the remediation work an incident case needs: repairs, replacement, account adjustments, and follow-up contact.",
  "description": "An original remediation work order for an open guest incident case. It records the case it belongs to, the authorized remediation lines with cost and approver, corrective work on the condition that caused the incident, the guest follow-up plan, approval limits and open conditions, and the verified completion handoff.",
  "use_case": "Use once a guest incident case has been reviewed and the venue has decided what it will do: fix a condition, replace property, adjust an account, or follow up with the guest. The order closes when every authorized line is verified complete and the guest has confirmed what was promised was done.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
  "sections": [
    {
