              "label": "Above limit",
              "units": 1.1,
              "field_type": "choice",
              "options": [
                "Not assessed",
                "No",
                "Yes - referred up",
                "Yes - approved above"
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "referred_to",
              "label": "Referred to",
              "units": 1.0
            },
            {
              "key": "insurer_notified",
              "label": "Insurer notified",
              "units": 1.15
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "remediation_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "What authorizing remediation does not mean",
          "guidance": "Providing a remedy is an operational service decision. It is not an admission of fault, an acceptance of liability, or a settlement of any claim, and nothing on this order should be described to the guest as either. Route any request for a settlement, a release, or a written acceptance of responsibility to the responsible manager and the insurer under applicable policy."
        }
      ]
    },
